code link # 📚 Library Management System

## 📌 Project Description

The Library Management System is a simple web-based application used to manage library books efficiently. It allows users to add, view, search, update, and delete book records.

This project is developed using a single HTML file containing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## 🎯 Objectives

* To manage library book records easily.
* To add new books to the library.
* To view all available book details.
* To search for books quickly.
* To update existing book information.
* To delete unwanted book records.
* To display available and issued books.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript
* Local Storage

## ✨ Features

### 1. Add Book

Users can add a new book by entering:

* Book Name
* Author Name
* Book ID
* Category
* Book Status

### 2. View Books

All book details are displayed in a table.

### 3. Search Book

Users can search books using the book name, author name, or book ID.

### 4. Update Book

Existing book information can be edited and updated.

### 5. Delete Book

Users can delete a book record when it is no longer required.

### 6. Dashboard

The dashboard displays:

* Total Books
* Available Books
* Issued Books

### 7. Local Storage

Book data is stored in the browser using JavaScript Local Storage.

